# tally 2.2 (CHANGES.md 2.2-5, the lead's bound P4, critic C-11), L §4.5's list: a version's same line with a planned
# instance on a side keeps its clock. Two planned moves of 100.00 PLN on one day, stated same by a version known
# 2026-05-01: before it is known they are two movements (200.00 PLN), after it one (100.00 PLN). The critic's s5mm.
=== m.tally
model s5mm
  tally 2
  on 2026-06-10
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
place wallet: accounts PLN lives 2025-01-01..
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..
input d1: date
input a1: money PLN

move in1: transfers
  on d1
  leg cash from world to wallet amount a1
move in2: transfers
  on d1
  leg cash from world to wallet amount a1

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2025-12-01
  d1 = 2026-03-05 "s"
  a1 = 100.00 PLN "s"
  opening[wallet] = 0.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "s"

version later
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-05-01
  same in1 = in2

ask today: bal(wallet, 2026-03-31)
ask before: bal(wallet, 2026-03-31) as known 2026-04-01
=== expect
before: 200.00 PLN
  unfulfilled: in1
  unfulfilled: in2
  cut 2026-04-01
today: 100.00 PLN
  unfulfilled: in2
  cut 2026-06-10
